<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First Investors Financial.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First Investors Financial.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Stephens Inc said it downgraded First Investors Financial Services Group Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- First Investors lost 1/4 to 7-3/8.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
